<title>USA: Mercury Air Group sets 5-for-4 stock split.</title>
<headline>Mercury Air Group sets 5-for-4 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mercury Air Group Inc said Tuesday its board had set a 5-for-4 stock split, payable April 11, record March 27.</p>
<p>The company said cash will be paid in lieu of fractional shares.</p>
<p>The split will increase Mercury's fully diluted weighted average shares outstanding to about 11.9 million from 9.5 million.</p>
